{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04622","headline":"奉和同皇太子过慈恩寺应制二首 一 · 张说","name":"奉和同皇太子过慈恩寺应制二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翼翼宸恩永，煌煌福地开。\n离光升宝殿，震气绕香台。\n上界幡花合，中天伎乐来。\n愿君无量寿，仙乐屡徘徊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04622.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04622","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}